.TH ZHEN\-UI\-FRONT 1 "2026-11-09" "unheaded 50a3c532" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
zhen\-ui\-front \- Terminate hybrid\-only TLS 1.3 for the Zhen web UI and proxy to its Unix socket (ADR\-138).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-ui\-front
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminate hybrid\-only TLS 1.3 for the Zhen web UI and proxy to its Unix socket (ADR\-138).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fIVALUE\fR
IP:PORT to serve TLS on, repeatable; no wildcard address (default 127.0.0.1:20103)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-body \fIN\fR
request body cap in bytes (default 4194304)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-conns \fIN\fR
client connections at once, across every listener (default 256)
.TP
.B \-\-metrics \fISTRING\fR
loopback IP:PORT for /metrics, /health and /ready, plain HTTP (default 127.0.0.1:20112)
.TP
.B \-\-socket \fISTRING\fR
the app's Unix socket (default /run/unheaded\-zhen\-ui/app.sock)
.TP
.B \-\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
time the app has to start answering a request (default 8m0s)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH NOTES
The certificate and key are the files UNHEADED_TLS_CERT and UNHEADED_TLS_KEY_FILE name; without both the
front refuses to start. There is no plaintext mode, and UNHEADED_TLS_PROFILE is not read: key exchange is
hybrid ML\-KEM only, so a client without it fails the handshake. The socket must not be open to other users.
Forwarding headers from clients are dropped; the app gets the TCP peer in X\-Unheaded\-Client\-Addr.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zhen\-ui\-front \-\-listen 127.0.0.1:20103 \-\-socket /run/unheaded\-zhen\-ui/app.sock
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
